                "text": "The weather in San Francisco is currently around 22°C and windy. Here are some clothing suggestions:\n\n1. **Light Layers**: A lightweight long-sleeve shirt or a light sweater will keep you comfortable, especially if the wind picks up.\n2. **Pants or Jeans**: Comfortable pants or jeans are a good choice.\n3. **Windbreaker**: A windbreaker or light jacket can help protect you from the wind.\n4. **Comfortable Shoes**: Wear shoes suitable for walking, as you'll likely want to explore.\n\nConsider bringing a scarf or light hat if you tend to feel cold in the wind. Enjoy your time in San Francisco!"
